-- =============================================================================
-- 8) MEETINGS
-- SQL Server tables: meetings + invoices + bookings + plans + users +
-- plan_registerations
-- Cassandra tables: meetings_by_mentee + meetings_by_mentor + meetings_by_id
-- Why three writes: each dashboard and meeting detail page has its own
-- partition-friendly table.
-- =============================================================================

